          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "As a Shopper, I want to see full product details for each item in my cart, so that I can review what I am purchasing before proceeding to checkout.\n\nEach line item on the cart page displays the product image, name, price, colour, size, quantity stepper, and Remove and Wishlist links. This applies across all storefronts on desktop, tablet, and mobile. All line item data is served from SFCC via the PWA Kit. This story covers UI rendering only.\n\n_UI Design Kit:_ [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=ovFDfWzE9zVA0T9q-0|https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=ovFDfWzE9zVA0T9q-0|smart-link] \n\nCart Designs: [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=4534-86084&t=fNANwHd5P8MwAxVA-0|https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=4534-86084&t=fNANwHd5P8MwAxVA-0|smart-link] \n\nNote: Gift Card Products will be covered in Gift Cards Epic. Non-Returnable/Refundable messaging will be covered in Returns/Refunds Epic.\n\n*Image for reference (figma leading):*\n\n!image-20260824-235534.png|width=184,alt=\"image-20260824-235534.png\"!",
          "to_string": "As a Shopper, I want to see full product details for each item in my cart, so that I can review what I am purchasing before proceeding to checkout.\n\nEach line item on the cart page displays the product image, name, price, colour, size, quantity stepper, and Remove and Wishlist links. This applies across all storefronts on desktop, tablet, and mobile. All line item data is served from SFCC via the PWA Kit. This story covers UI rendering only.\n\n* Behaviour of (+) (-) controls are defined in [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-271|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-271|smart-link] \n* Behaviour of “Remove” and “Wishlist” are defined in [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-272|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-272|smart-link] \n\n_UI Design Kit:_ [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=ovFDfWzE9zVA0T9q-0|https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=40002540-26065&p=f&t=ovFDfWzE9zVA0T9q-0|smart-link] \n\nCart Designs: [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=4534-86084&t=fNANwHd5P8MwAxVA-0|https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann_Designs?node-id=4534-86084&t=fNANwHd5P8MwAxVA-0|smart-link] \n\nNote: Gift Card Products will be covered in Gift Cards Epic. Non-Returnable/Refundable messaging will be covered in Returns/Refunds Epic.\n\n*Image for reference (figma leading):*\n\n!image-20260824-235534.png|width=184,alt=\"image-20260824-235534.png\"!"
        }
