          "fieldtype": "custom",
          "from_string": "# Given a Shopper has items in their cart, when they open the cart page, then each line item displays the product image.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the product name is displayed to the right of the image.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the product price is displayed for that item.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the selected colour is displayed for that item.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the selected size is displayed for that item.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the current quantity is displayed with increment (+) and decrement (–) controls either side.\n# Given a Shopper has multiple different items in their cart, when the page loads, then all items are listed and each is individually identifiable.\n# Given a Shopper views the cart on mobile, when the page renders, then all line item details (image, name, price, colour, size, quantity) are visible and no detail is truncated or hidden.",
          "to_string": "# Given a Shopper has items in their cart, when they open the cart page, then each line item displays the product image.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the product name is displayed to the right of the image.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the product price is displayed for that item.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the selected colour is displayed for that item.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the selected size is displayed for that item.\n# Given a line item is rendered, when the page loads, then the current quantity is displayed with increment (+) and decrement (–) controls either side.\n# Given a Shopper has multiple different items in their cart, when the page loads, then all items are listed and each is individually identifiable.\n# Given a cart item tile renders, when the page loads, then Remove and Wishlist are displayed as underlined text links below the quantity stepper.\n# Given a Shopper views the cart on mobile, when the page renders, then all line item details (image, name, price, colour, size, quantity) are visible and no detail is truncated or hidden.",
