          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "As a Shopper, I want to see full product details for each item in my cart, so that I can review what I am purchasing before proceeding to checkout.\n\nEach line item on the cart page displays the product image, name, price, colour, size, and quantity. This applies across all storefronts on both desktop and mobile. All line item data is served from SFCC via the PWA Kit.",
          "to_string": "As a Shopper, I want to see full product details for each item in my cart, so that I can review what I am purchasing before proceeding to checkout.\n\nEach line item on the cart page displays the product image, name, price, colour, size, and quantity. This applies across all storefronts on both desktop and mobile. All line item data is served from SFCC via the PWA Kit.\n\n*Image for reference (figma leading):*\n\n!image-20260802-230931.png|width=875,alt=\"image-20260802-230931.png\"!"
